          "id": "1a931239-e891-4e0d-80d2-84e6a3201213",
          "memory": "On Saturday afternoon, October 10, 2026, Maya was couch-trapped and postponing folding laundry by an hour, while User woke up from a couch nap more tired, stayed in blanket mode with possible takeout later, and joked to enjoy the rot.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "86efdebd-31c1-43d8-97c8-a98d5b9a88d4",
          "memory": "On October 10, 2026, User finally watered droopy plants feeling guilty in a redemption arc, while Maya's miracle basil was still alive after being moved to the windowsill for more sun because her kitchen was too dark, which User said also makes their own plants sad.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ec3b7b5c-8392-459f-9b14-d4b875ef0052",
          "memory": "As of October 10, 2026, Maya's sister still had not signed up for pottery and was still saying someday, with User joking to tell the Tuesday instructor she is still thinking about it.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "8cbe4a4a-00a6-4b17-bf21-e22a048fc639",
          "memory": "Maya's sister is hosting her own birthday pizza party with about 6 friends at Rosa's at 4 pm on Saturday, October 17, 2026, with just her friend group and neither Maya nor User attending.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "16627847-263d-4ee9-bde6-ed1db9d5a0c9",
          "memory": "For the Rosa's birthday outing, Maya advised her sister to get garlic knots with a half order to start, ask for patio seating if nice, recalled their iconic knots-plus-salad balance order and wobbly-chair check, and steered her from Luigi's to Rosa's after last week's menu confusion.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "124ec009-de74-41d7-ad13-04fdd212b36f",
          "memory": "By October 10, 2026, Maya had sent User the name of the chaotic baking show with the mop cake, which User finally watched as perfect background noise, calling it unhinged for making cake look like cleaning supplies with confused judges, while Maya was rewatching it to avoid laundry.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "9d572376-4122-46b9-8e93-f4e0a2f889d4",
          "memory": "On October 10, 2026, Maya's laundry chair pile lived on after she added to it that day, and User reported the same system with no shame, linking to earlier chair-pile decor and laundry never leaving the dryer.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "a225bca6-b7ea-4b12-9729-91e13006547f",
          "memory": "User attended pottery on Tuesday, October 6, 2026, and made something that might be a lopsided mug to match the wavy key-holding bowl as a full functional-art set, inviting Maya and her sister to join in October to be messy together.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "3cb48cb2-017f-4838-b3b9-57151577bdc2",
          "memory": "On the chilly October 10, 2026 afternoon with the window open, Maya planned canned tomato soup with grilled cheese, which User called perfect soup weather and elite when paired with grilled cheese.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
